      <div class="pw-what-col">
        <h3>Always know where you stand.</h3>
        <p>
          H2H puts five real-time overlays on your screen while you race.
          See the gap to the car ahead and behind, know if you're catching or
          losing time, and pit at the right lap.
        </p>
        <p>
          Designed to be scannable in a glance, with the same colour language
          you already see on the broadcast. Read your race without taking your
          eyes off it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pw-what-col">
        <h3>Drop into SimHub or OBS.</h3>
        <p>
          Bundled SimHub dashboards are included in the download. Import them
          and you're done. Or paste each overlay's URL as a Browser Source in
          OBS for your stream.
        </p>
        <p>
          No account, no cloud, no subscription. It all runs on your machine,
          and it's free and open source.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
